id: battle-at-the-edge
name: Battle at the Edge
talentCategory: threshold
prerequisites: High Risk Battler
description: >
  Living dangerously is your motto; you are at your fiercest when you are close to death.
text: >
  Battle at the Edge: Living dangerously is your motto; you are at your fiercest when you are close to death.
  –Prerequisites: High Risk Battler
  (1)-[Passive]: While you are below the Critical Health Threshold, increase your Combat Rolls and Soak Value by 1(bT).
  (2)-[Triggered/Defeated]: Roll a 1d10. If you score a result of 7 or higher, set your Life Points to 1 lower than the Critical Health Threshold.

---

[passive]
# (1) Below Critical - in it.
if (belowThreshold("critical")) {
    combatRolls += 1(bT);
    soakValue += 1(bT);
}

# (2) Ticked on the Defeated card - a Triggered/Defeated effect, the Keyword's one of the Encounter: a 1d10, and on 7 or more
# your Life Points 1 under the Critical Health Threshold - a tenth of your Max, rounded down - at 1 at least (chat.mjs
# battleEdge).
[triggered/defeated, effect 2]
battleEdge();
